{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー ちゅけさん ーーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJ9AiWz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんだけ経ってから載せてんねん！と"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "言われてしまいそうですが、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "武元唯衣さんの卒業セレモニーの写真たちです〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobwkoec3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobM1P8mz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒セレの演出かっこよすぎます！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "直前のリハーサルでドレスからパンツスタイルになることを知り、どれだけエンターテイナーなんだこの方！！と感動しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「油を注せ！」大好きなので、また一緒に踊ることができてとっても嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ダンストラックも一緒に踊れて嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゅけさんの作ってくださるダンスは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゅけさんの「ダンスたのしい！！」っていう気持ちが伝わってきて、自然と笑顔になっちゃいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入して少ない3rd TOURの頃"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ本番前にハグをするルーティンがあって、それがとーーってもうれしくて、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "徐々にそれはなくなってしまったけど、国立初日"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゅけさんが私の所にきて抱きしめてくださって、覚えていてくださってたんだって思って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても幸せでした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オープニングのラストに手をぎゅってしてくださったのも忘れてないです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobwaGieN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツに加入してからより近くでちゅけさんのことを見ることが増えて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この方には出来ないことはないんじゃないかって思わされるくらいかっこいい背中を見せてくださりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "常に目の前の状況に真っ直ぐ向き合っている姿"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に尊敬してます。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobU530aZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobbiXD9Y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この写真だいすき"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobivPJ7O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobevFx27.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob5S77K2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTxtrq0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobmlyKkF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobmdZTsK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobLzdOup.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob1q73aP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob4zrwuo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobUG0Hod.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNWfFaM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobO0ChPc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob58bwlb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "滋賀ロケも楽しかったなぁ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜーーーった